25ix|a|Not improved; not made better or wiser; not advanced in knowledge, manners, or excellence. ; Not used; not employed; especially, not used or employed for a valuable purpose; as, unimproved opportunities; unimproved blessings. ; Not tilled, cultivated, or built upon; yielding no revenue; as, unimproved land or soil.	j:153v,67,1~153v,67,1
